@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> R1

state R1 <<choice>>
R1 --> IdentifyUser : [user makes request]
R1 --> GatherVideos : [system gathers videos based on user profile and preferences]

state GatherVideos <<choice>>
GatherVideos --> AddDetails : [add thumbnails and view counts]
GatherVideos --> SendSuggestions : [send suggested videos to user]

state "Identify User" as IdentifyUser
IdentifyUser : entry / identify user
IdentifyUser : do / verify user identity
IdentifyUser : exit / user identified

state "Send Suggestions" as SendSuggestions
SendSuggestions : entry / send suggestions
SendSuggestions : do / deliver videos to user
SendSuggestions : exit / suggestions sent

@enduml
